<script setup lang="ts">import {Result} from '../types/domain';import {number} from '../utils/format';defineProps<{result:Result}>();</script><template><section class="dispersion-panel"><div class="section-top"><h3>组内离散度置换检验</h3><span>与组间检验共用冻结样本 / CLR / 替换 / 种子</span></div><template v-if="result.statistics.dispersion.status==='testable'"><div class="dispersion-verdict"><div><span>离散度R² / 置换p</span><b>{{number(result.statistics.dispersion.R2,4)}}</b><small>p {{number(result.statistics.dispersion.p,4)}} / {{result.statistics.dispersion.null_count}}次有效置换</small></div><div><span>离散度pseudo-F</span><b>{{result.statistics.dispersion.F_status==='unbounded'?'无界':result.statistics.dispersion.F_status==='numerical_overflow'?'超范围':number(result.statistics.dispersion.F,5)}}</b><small>{{result.statistics.dispersion.F_status}}</small></div></div><p class="dispersion-caveat">仅描述“组差是否伴随离散度不同”。这是与组间PERMANOVA分别进行的检验，不证明工艺原因；p不小不等于离散度同质。</p></template><template v-else><p class="dispersion-unavailable"><b>{{result.statistics.dispersion.status==='not_recorded'?'历史运行未记录：':'无法检验：'}}</b>{{result.statistics.dispersion.reason}}</p><p class="dispersion-caveat">缺值不当作显著，也不当作同质；组间检验结论仍单独有效。</p></template></section></template>
